    family-names: Fantinato
    affiliation: "UNICAMP/FEEC"
abstract: >-
  An adversarial reinforcement learning framework for IoT network defense over
  the CICIoT2023 dataset. A reactive tug-of-war attacker walks the kill chain
  under proximity-coupled escalation, and a windowed PPO defender learns
  graduated force-continuum policies under genuine partial observability
  (observation aliasing, session-coherent sampling). The defender never
  observes the true kill-chain stage, making the task a real sequential
  inference problem rather than a disguised per-flow classification.
